'''Ultimate Big Chill''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[Necrofriggian (Classic)|Necrofriggian]].

==Appearance==
Ultimate Big Chill looks mostly the same as his [[Big Chill (Classic)|regular form]] in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' except his skin is recolored red, his wings and antennae have a flame design, and he had crests over his eyes with the same design. Similar to Big Chill, Ultimate Big Chill can make his wings and antennae fold into a cloak.

Ultimate Big Chill wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

