Ultimate Big Chill is capable of breathing "ice flames", which he describes as "fire so cold it burns".<ref name="HEWTL">''[[Hit 'Em Where They Live]]''</ref> These flames are plasma beams that consume the heat of whatever they touch.{{Refn|[[:File:UEE Cannot Duplicate.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Jetray Speed Limit.png]]|group = MW}} Ultimate Big Chill can also shoot said ice flames from his hands.<ref name="EfA">''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''</ref>

Ultimate Big Chill's breath and beams are both stronger and colder than his [[Big Chill (Classic)|devolved form]], capable of instantly turning the air around him and his enemies into solid ice.<ref name="EfA" /><ref name="Deep" /> Ultimate Big Chill can also use his ice flames to make ice constructs, which also make his surroundings extremely cold and cause snowfall.<ref name="UA">''[[Ultimate Aggregor (Episode)|Ultimate Aggregor]]''</ref> Additionally, Ultimate Big Chill can create vortexes of his ice flames by generating an ice flame trail and quickly flying around his opponent.<ref name="EfA" />

Ultimate Big Chill retains his devolved form's abilities of fast flight and intangibility.<ref name="Deep" /> He can also turn fully invisible.{{Refn|[[:File:Bigheatprofile.PNG]]|group = CN}}

Ultimate Big Chill can cause opponents and objects to freeze by phasing through them if he chooses to.<ref name="EfA" />

Ultimate Big Chill has enhanced strength, as demonstrated by [[Sentient Ultimate Big Chill]].<ref name="TUS">''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref> Ultimate Big Chill is durable enough to survive getting smacked by a [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustar]], as demonstrated by Sentient Ultimate Big Chill.<ref name="TUS"/>

Like Big Chill, Ultimate Big Chill can also survive underwater.<ref name="Deep">''[[Deep]]''</ref>

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
====Cartoon Network Action Pack!====
Ultimate Big Chill is capable of firing freeze rays from his hands.<ref name="Jail Break">''[[Jail Break]]''</ref>

==Weaknesses==
[[File:VTS (279).png|thumb|218x218px|Electricity Vulnerability]]
Like his base form, Ultimate Big Chill is vulnerable to electricity, such as that generated by a [[Transylian]].<ref>''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]''</ref>

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*Ultimate Big Chill first appeared in ''[[Hit 'Em Where They Live]]'', where he defeated [[Vulkanus]] and [[Pickaxe Alien|his minions]].
*In ''[[Escape From Aggregor]]'', Ultimate Big Chill battled [[Galapagus]].
*In ''[[Ultimate Aggregor (Episode)|Ultimate Aggregor]]'', Ultimate Big Chill defended himself from some fans.
*In ''[[Deep]]'', Ultimate Big Chill chased [[Ultimate Aggregor]] and defeated some [[Piscciss Volann (Classic)|Piscciss Volann]] [[Piscciss Core Guards|guards]] before switching into [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]] to save [[Piscciss]].
*In ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', Ultimate Big Chill fought and froze some Zarkovian soldiers and was later defeated by the undead [[Dr. Viktor]].
*In ''[[Greetings From Techadon]]'', Ultimate Big Chill battled a [[Techadon Robot]] before switching into [[Echo Echo]].
*In ''[[The Flame Keepers' Circle]]'', Ultimate Big Chill defeated some [[Esoterica]].

