==Trivia==
*Just like [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]], Ultimate Big Chill's mouth doesn't move when he speaks.
*Ultimate Big Chill was the [[Alien of the Month]] in July 2011.
*Ultimate Big Chill is the first [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] to have a Nano in ''[[FusionFall]]''.
*Ultimate Big Chill was replaced by his regular form for the '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' version of ''[[Game Creator]]''.
*Ultimate Big Chill was originally supposed to appear a second time in ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'' to defeat [[Dr. Viktor|King Viktor]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/f6/VTS_Script_First_Draft_V1_with_Dwayne%27s_Edits.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script First Draft with Dwayne McDuffie's Edits (First Version)]|group = script|name = first1}}
*Had Ultimate Big Chill appeared in '''Omniverse''' as one of [[Albedo]]'s transformations, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] would have given him some kind of cold weather-controlling powers to make him more unique compared to what was shown in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ultimate Big Chill Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Derrick had also considered giving Ultimate Big Chill some [[Wikipedia:Mothra|Mothra]]-inspired powers.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ultimate Big Chill Mothra Powers.png]]|group = DJW}}

